{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"马尔代夫","country_iso":"MDV","created_at":"2026-03-23T10:21:24.077339","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"MDV-HB-0006","ldc":"No","location":"阿杜市","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"马尔代夫阿杜发电及配网项目","project_name_en":"Maldives Addu Power Generation and Distribution Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"东方国际","content":"近日，东方国际在马尔代夫首都马累成功签订马尔代夫阿杜发电及配网项目EPC总承包合同。东方国际副总经理孙震平及相关部门人员出席签约仪式。\n该项目位于马尔代夫第二大城市阿杜市（Addu City），项目建成后将极大缓解当地电力短缺压力，为当地及周边岛屿未来经济发展和居民生活用电提供充足的保障。\n该项目是东方国际继马尔代夫发电及海水淡化项目（50MW）和马尔代夫大马累岛环网一期项目之后，在马尔代夫签订的又一个意义重大的电力基础设施建设项目，是东方国际属地化经营，深耕当地市场的又一成果。\n东方国际将以此签约为契机，进一步拓展在马务实合作，为中马高质量共建“一带一路”作出积极贡献。","content_sha256":"e396c50bf9b65d1ee38f4e66b9e7968002e94d12ad981c614e15cbf35667bdb0","id":8601,"publish_date":"2024-04-28 16:40:03","title":"东方国际签订马尔代夫阿杜发电及配网项目EPC总承包合同","title_sha256":"c52724c3a001b8fb04e7896beae0941ed61948ee52386d30d0508e57a263151d","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/64602.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"MDV-HB-0006","capacity_details":"","capacity_mw":null,"capacity_mw_raw":"","capacity_source":null,"contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:21:24.077507","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"MDV-HB-0006-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"http://www.gongyetoutiao.com/channel/content.aspx?id=18034\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"","project_developer_en":null,"project_stage":"签约","project_summary":"东方国际在马尔代夫签订了阿杜发电及配网项目的EPC总承包合同。该项目位于马尔代夫阿杜市，旨在缓解当地电力短缺，为当地及周边岛屿提供电力保障。这是东方国际在马尔代夫的又一重要电力基础设施建设项目。","publish_